        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​Immerse yourself in the captivating world of ancient Egypt with <strong>PyramidValley: Reborn</strong>, a compelling management game that invites you to build and develop your own pharaonic city. Play as iconic figures such as Cleopatra, and construct legendary monuments like majestic pyramids, the Lighthouse of Alexandria, and the Great Sphinx.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and manage various resources to ensure your city's prosperity, while taking on strategic challenges that will test your managerial skills. With meticulous graphics and an immersive atmosphere, <strong>PyramidValley: Reborn</strong> offers a rewarding gaming experience for all history enthusiasts and management game fans.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, the <strong>Reborn</strong> project aims to revive the game by allowing players to relive the <strong>PyramidValley</strong> experience independently, thus ensuring the continuity of this Egyptian adventure.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sources</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​Immerse yourself in the captivating world of ancient Egypt with <strong>PyramidValley: Reborn</strong>, a compelling management game that invites you to build and develop your own pharaonic city. Play as iconic figures such as Cleopatra, and construct legendary monuments like majestic pyramids, the Lighthouse of Alexandria, and the Great Sphinx.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and manage various resources to ensure your city's prosperity, while taking on strategic challenges that will test your managerial skills. With meticulous graphics and an immersive atmosphere, <strong>PyramidValley: Reborn</strong> offers a rewarding gaming experience for all history enthusiasts and management game fans.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, the <strong>Reborn</strong> project aims to revive the game by allowing players to relive the <strong>PyramidValley</strong> experience independently, thus ensuring the continuity of this Egyptian adventure.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sources</p>",
        "short_description": "​Immerse yourself in ancient Egypt with PyramidValley, a management game where you develop your pharaonic city by constructing iconic monuments and gathering various resources to ensure prosperity.",
